      "delta": "Block\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"This dashboard covers 12 months of MRR data broken down across Enterprise, Pro, and Starter plans"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1785729109",
      "delta": ". New MRR, expansion MRR, and churned MRR are summed by month to show how each component contributes to net growth"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1785729109",
      "delta": ". Cumulative MRR is the running total of net MRR added over the period. Monthly churn rate reflects the percentage of prior-"
    },
    {
      "type": "text-delta",
      "id": "msg_1785729109",
      "delta": "month MRR that was lost. Use the Plan filter to isolate a specific tier — the component bars and headline"
